  "body": "## Scoped construction (2026-10-16 KST)\n\nContinue immutable [BASS_HE HE20 PR #66](https://github.com/cosmosapjw-quantum/BASS_HE/pull/66), parent `ccd9125e6776f3f8d3388d70c6675873464c5f30`, with a **new independent Python photo-only source-age reference**, not a replacement for original native Grackle H/He Case-A.\n\nRead/compare [bass_cr C19 PR #72](https://github.com/cosmosapjw-quantum/bass_cr/pull/72) owner-linked endpoint chemical coupling `e91ffe368c4e6db64c4b6c5962566302a33402b6` and [rei_bianchi PR #152 v2](https://github.com/cosmosapjw-quantum/rei_bianchi/pull/152) original Verner fitting parameters `bbbd18b5c16eff70bc32ba4296360dceb9060ec4` (three extracted H/He donor rows; complete donor raw SHA is *cited*, not independently redownloaded). Source spectral form and emitted photons per H are pinned to the HE20 cold MD14 q0,m16,n128 C8 result. **New approximations**: prescribed constant emission per ln a, local-normal isotropic birth angles, positive HE20 source subcell spectral quadrature split at future H/He fit threshold preimages, photo-only implicit endpoint gas, no CI/RR/DR/Compton or recombination escape. Initial nominal cold z20 nH and T are source-scoped and not production cosmological calibration.\n\n## Mathematics and execution evidence\n\nExplicit real Verner H I/He I/He II cross-sections, signed LRS Killing redshift, age-tagged positive photon cohorts, forward photon number/energy/spectral support, competing-risk exact exponential absorption, gas ionization/temperature update with charge, electron, chemical binding, photoheat, photon redshift work and gas adiabatic work. Independent Wolfram stoichiometric charge/energy identities zero. Implemented and **actually executed in local Python 3.13.5** with NumPy 2.3.5: focused **10/10 pytest PASS**, **27 distinct 3q\u00d73energy\u00d73time numerical cases** using 3 local subprocesses. Maximum relative number defect 1.2242e-15, relative total energy 3.6079e-16, absolute electron defect 2.965e-21; all positive spectral supports avoid physical fit thresholds at chemical midpoints.\n\nExample conditional q0, m16, steps16: A_HI=3.201997447152771e-6, A_HeI=2.5320912875012755e-7, A_HeII=1.4056182632971931e-14 photon/H; photoheat=2.0221673074953515e-5 eV/H; Tgas=8.241238335323104 K. These **are not genuine Grackle or H/He EoR production results**. Corrected actual q0,m4 time-step source readback from the 27-case CSV is n4\u21928\u219216 with HI events 3.204608580758689e-6\u21923.2040821355557896e-6\u21923.201997446536296e-6. Adjacent changes increase rather than enter an established asymptotic regime; no certified global time convergence. The earlier draft's n16\u219232\u219264 wording and two unsupported values are withdrawn.\n\nAll runnable source, tests, data, ledgers, machine-readable status and report are tracked under `research/he21_positive_source_age_20261016/`; replay with `python -m pytest -q tests/test_he21.py` and `PYTHONPATH=src python src/run_study.py`. Saved-source and method authority remain separate from numerical identity and observational claims.\n\n## Runtime and backup limits\n\n**NCP HE21 run NOT_RUN**: Desktop Commander remote connector reached its monthly quota. We did NOT reconnect or claim NCP CPU measurements. Current sandbox has 5 vCPUs, 5.8 GiB RAM, Python and no Rust toolchain; source-only Python verification is real, native Rust coupling is not. No native subagent action exposed (NOT_RUN). No mutation to original rei_bianchi, bass_cr or NCP BASS_HE. The superseding v3 report/source tar.gz (15,251 bytes, SHA256 `0281eea958727160dde46fb0d8ebd99dde04b237ab3da43444f3763ca733cc6b`) is preserved alongside earlier v1/v2 in Library and Google Drive; actual authenticated Drive full-file restore, tar content and six manifest member SHA256 checks PASS under `BASS_DERIVATION_DOSSIERS_20260912/HE21_SOURCE_AGE_PHOTO_ONLY_20261016/`; Google Drive full raw-file materialization independently matched the original SHA and archive member listing. Dropbox remains NOT_WRITTEN due connector write limit. Preserve **Draft/unmerged**.\n\nNext real gate: source-clock-preserving children directly into original Grackle `igm_point_rhs` with CI/RR/DR/CMB and Case-A escaping photons, then same-epoch 2D energy\u00d7time convergence on NCP and PR150 covariant-state comparison, without rotating this conditional surrogate into production.",
